{"v":1,"book":"Ezek","ch":4,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"Now you, son of man, take a tile and set it before you; and inscribe on it a city, Jerusalem;","tok":[{"t":"Now you, "},{"t":"son","s":["H1121"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"man","s":["H0120"],"a":[2]},{"t":", "},{"t":"take","s":["H3947"],"a":[3]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"tile","s":["H3843"],"a":[5]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"set","s":["H5414"],"a":[6]},{"t":" it "},{"t":"before","s":["H6440"],"a":[8]},{"t":" you; and inscribe on it a "},{"t":"city","s":["H5892"],"a":[11]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Jerusalem","s":["H3389"],"a":[13]},{"t":";"}]},{"n":2,"text":"And lay a siege against it, and build a siege wall against it, and cast up a mound against it, and set up camps against it, and set battering rams all around it.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"lay","s":["H5414"],"a":[0]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"siege","s":["H4692"],"a":[2]},{"t":" against it, and "},{"t":"build","s":["H1129"],"a":[3]},{"t":" a siege wall against it, and "},{"t":"cast","s":["H8210"],"a":[6]},{"t":" up a mound against it, and "},{"t":"set","s":["H5414"],"a":[9]},{"t":" up "},{"t":"camps","s":["H4264"],"a":[11]},{"t":" against it, and "},{"t":"set","s":["H7760"],"a":[12]},{"t":" battering "},{"t":"rams","s":["H3733"],"a":[14]},{"t":" all around it."}]},{"n":3,"text":"And take an iron plate and set it as an iron wall between you and the city, and set your face against it; and it will be under siege, and you shall lay siege against it. This will be a sign to the house of Israel.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"take","s":["H3947"],"a":[1]},{"t":" an "},{"t":"iron","s":["H1270"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"plate","s":["H4227"],"a":[3]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"set","s":["H5414"],"a":[5]},{"t":" it as an "},{"t":"iron","s":["H1270"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"wall","s":["H7023"],"a":[7]},{"t":" between you and the "},{"t":"city","s":["H5892"],"a":[11]},{"t":", and "},{"t":"set","s":["H3559"],"a":[12]},{"t":" your "},{"t":"face","s":["H6440"],"a":[14]},{"t":" against it; and it will be under siege,